  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support Gender Equality in and through Education in Maghreb countries</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The intervention in Maghreb countries will be framed by UNESCO Strategy for Gender Equality in and Through Education (2019-2025), and its two strategic objectives focusing on system-wide transformation to benefit all learners, and targeted inventions to empower girls and women through education. It drives action towards the attainment of both SDG 4 on education and SDG 5 on gender equality and women&apos;s empowerment, in order to fight stereotypes at various levels of the systems and support gender-transformative actions in teaching and learning, with a view to successful insertion into labour markets.</narrative>
  </description>
